[1m== GROWTH 8. The per-contact timeline (endpoint 9) is PII, and this run cannot probe it[0m
   The probe worth running is the CONTRAST: a store admin must be refused (403 growth.contact_pii.read is
   PowerUser-only in v1) while the PowerUser is served. Two things block it here, and neither is fixable
   from a seed:
     * there is one identity, not two: the only store admin of store 1 is +4799681931 and that
       same account holds PowerUserRole, so there is no un-privileged store admin to be refused.
     * the route needs a contactPointId, and NO endpoint hands one out -- deliberately. Endpoint 11 masks
       membership to counts and the audit read for this store answers an empty event list. The only
       contact-point ids this seed could learn are ones it created itself by confirming a guest, which is
       the step step 6 cannot perform.

